    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "ja": "なお、アローダイアグラムを使ったプロジェクトの分析手法を「PERT（Program Evaluation and Review Technique）」と呼びます。",
      "vi": "Ngoài ra, phương pháp phân tích dự án sử dụng Arrow Diagram gọi là \"PERT (Program Evaluation and Review Technique)\".",
      "en": "Also, the project analysis method using Arrow Diagram is called 'PERT (Program Evaluation and Review Technique).'",
